OL,3,AMore than 1.9 million urged to evacuate
OL,4,Aas powerful typhoon batters Japan
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome 300 flights have been cancelled
OL,7,Fand some train services suspended
OL,9,FDujuan has sustained winds of 143km/h
OL,10,F(89mph) and gusts of up to 198km/h
OL,12,FThe storm is the latest in a wave of
OL,13,Fstorms in the Pacific, made more
OL,14,Fintense by this year's "super El Nino",
OL,15,Fwhich has warmed the ocean and fuelled
OL,16,Fthe formation of storms
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
